{"unit_id":"shadyyoung__dsh-shared-memory#feature-1","repo":"shadyyoung/dsh-shared-memory","commit":"e885d2f1a0ab4ab20c2db8aada59f931b85d1744","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Shared Memory 的功能「跨会话捕获与提示注入」：DSH 会话发生用户消息事件时，插件会记录根会话消息并跟踪会话动态；系统提示可加入焦点、近期记忆和相关记忆摘要。原话缓存按配置保留。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:2334-2364","index.js:2430-2479","index.js:1668-1719"]}
{"unit_id":"shadyyoung__dsh-shared-memory#feature-2","repo":"shadyyoung/dsh-shared-memory","commit":"e885d2f1a0ab4ab20c2db8aada59f931b85d1744","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Shared Memory 的功能「记忆写入与检索」：模型可调用 memory_remember 保存分类记忆和标签，再用 memory_search 按关键词、类型或标签查找；检索支持相关性或时间排序。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:2041-2105","index.js:1152-1185"]}
